Package: librkaiq
Architecture: arm64
Depends: systemd
Description: 3A libraries match Rockchip rkisp v30(rk3588)
 This package contains the runtime libraries for the RockChip AIQ camera engine,
 which provides 3A (Auto-Exposure, Auto-White-Balance, Auto-Focus) functionality
 for RK3588 ISP.

Package: librkaiq-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Depends: librkaiq (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Development files for librkaiq
 This package contains the header files and development libraries needed to
 build applications that use the RockChip AIQ camera engine.
 .
 The RockChip AIQ camera engine provides 3A (Auto-Exposure, Auto-White-Balance,
 Auto-Focus) functionality for RK3588 ISP.

